{"2505370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Future Weapon", "steam_appid": 2505370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505370/extras/e79f55895f3b91c08b2dd4d8636e0cb8.poster.avif?t=1773109153\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505370/extras/e79f55895f3b91c08b2dd4d8636e0cb8.webm?t=1773109153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the savior or the scourge of the universe. Fend off or join a massive fleet of space prisms invading the Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the Federation's anti-invasion checklist to survive. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grab A Friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grab A Gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grab A Ship</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505370/extras/f9dd17ead10d1fa34a00931c56710152.poster.avif?t=1773109153\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505370/extras/f9dd17ead10d1fa34a00931c56710152.webm?t=1773109153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine Ore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade the Spaceships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade the Upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit Colonists </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Show No Mercy  </p></li><li>